OL,3,ASemi-pro football club 'in shock' after
OL,4,Ashirt worn by Reading Festival
OL,5,Aheadliners
OL,6,
OL,7,FA semi-professional Welsh football club
OL,8,Fsay they were "in shock" after their
OL,9,Fshirt was worn during a Reading
OL,10,FFestival headline set.
OL,12,FGrian Chatten, frontman of the Irish
OL,13,Ffive-piece band Fontaines D.C., was
OL,14,Fseen sporting a green and white-striped
OL,15,FCwmbran Celtic away shirt during the
OL,16,Fperformance on Friday, leading to
OL,17,Fpre-sales of the shirt to "almost
OL,18,Fdouble".
OL,20,FThe club said "we're still in shock and
OL,21,Fcan't thank Grian enough for the
OL,22,Fsupport".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
